                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>• Sales peak during the year-end months, indicating strong seasonal demand.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>• The West and East regions contribute the highest sales.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>• South region generated positive sales and profit in 2021.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>• Sales and profit contributions vary significantly across regions, with a few regions accounting for a large share of overall performance.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>• Profitability generally follows sales trends but differs across regions due to varying margins.</run>
